MyWorkspaceRequestWrapper.description:
Request wrapper for fetching user's workspace. Supports fetching multiple resource types in a single call.
Set one or more of the request fields to fetch the corresponding resources. Results will be combined into a single response.

Examples:
- Fetch entities only: {"myEntitiesRequest": {"ownershipSource": "DIRECT", "entityTypes": ["service"]}}
- Fetch teams only: {"myTeamsRequest": {"includeMembers": true}}
- Fetch both entities and teams: {"myEntitiesRequest": {...}, "myTeamsRequest": {...}}
